lots for persistent effects. With 16 total Functions available, the system encourages experimentation with different combinations across multiple playthroughs.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/transistor", "videos": [{"id": 2459, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "qBhiy6gy97Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qBhiy6gy97Y", "title": "Transistor - Launch Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qBhiy6gy97Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 1726, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "GTik6sYT_BE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GTik6sYT_BE", "title": "Transistor - Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GTik6sYT_BE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 121337, "name": "E3 2019 Trailer", "video_id": "jEYPtp-UwNs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jEYPtp-UwNs", "title": "Transistor - E3 2019 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jEYPtp-UwNs/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "characters": [{"id": 2759, "name": "Royce"}, {"id": 2755, "name": "The Transistor"}, {"id": 2757, "name": "Sybil"}, {"id": 2758, "name": "Asher"}, {"id": 2756, "name": "Red"}]}